          <h3>AI for good</h3><p>Use machine learning and thoughtful automation to make everyday life a little better.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="track-card">
          <span class="track-number">TRACK 02</span>
          <span class="track-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s8-4 8-11V5l-8-3-8 3v5c0 7 8 11 8 11Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
