        </article>
        <article class="track-card">
          <span class="track-number">TRACK 03</span>
          <span class="track-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v2m0 14v2M5.64 5.64l1.42 1.42m9.88 9.88 1.42 1.42M3 12h2m14 0h2M5.64 18.36l1.42-1.42m9.88-9.88 1.42-1.42M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Open innovation</h3><p>Got a bold idea that doesn't fit a box? Bring it, build it, and show us where it can go.</p>
        </article>
